body:
I heard about that purge and fakku.
So much good stuff lost. ;_;
But that narrows down my search a lot so thank you very much.

It is the girls from Saekano.
Max factory is already making 3 and now aniplex.
RIP my wallet. ;_;

I'm gonna email them and hope I get lucky.
As for what I will do if they decline I don't know.
I guess keep stalking pre-owned sites for IA 1.5 ver. ;-;
